DESCRIPTION >
    Regression scenario for the tb ingest parser change reported in Slack
    (tb ~4.6.14): a Map column fails to append when the source JSON object
    has the same set of keys on every row, because ClickHouse's native JSON
    schema inference prefers a Named Tuple over a Map in that case, and
    CAST(Tuple, Map) only works for 2-element tuples.

SCHEMA >
    `asset_id` String `json:$.asset_id`,
    `properties` Map(String, Nullable(String)) `json:$.properties`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "asset_id"
